# Vendored SDK headers (VapourSynth API4, AviSynth+ C interface). They are
# third-party code, are never edited by hand, and only ever change wholesale
# when a newer SDK is vendored in - a ~2800-line diff that carries no
# reviewable information and would drown the real changes. Suppress it by
# default; `git diff --text include/` still shows the full diff on demand.
# linguist-vendored additionally keeps them out of GitHub's language stats and
# collapses them in the web diff.
/include/** -diff linguist-vendored

# Binary test fixtures (Annex-B elementary streams). Git already auto-detects
# these as binary, but say so explicitly so no future fixture can be mangled by
# an EOL conversion or produce a garbage textual diff.
*.264 binary
*.mvc  binary
